5:["$","p",null,{"className":"rn-lead max-w-3xl lg:pt-8","children":"There is no common stock feed standard in South Africa. Every DMS exports something different, and the usual result is a car that sold on Tuesday still live on Friday, a price that is right in one place and wrong in another, and photos that arrive in the wrong order."}]
